# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendor / third-party material -- MUST NEVER BE PUBLISHED.
#
# eteq was developed by reverse-engineering the OmniVision OV780 WiFi camera
# protocol. The working material below is the vendor's copyrighted software
# (the Android app, its decompiled Java sources, and disassembly of its native
# library) plus unrelated personal research notes. Redistributing any of it
# would infringe the vendor's copyright, so these paths stay local-only. The
# documented *protocol* lives in docs/PROTOCOL.md; the inputs do not ship.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.apk
WIFI+TOOL_*.apk
decompiled/
analysis/
compass_artifact_*.md
jadx.cmd

# Personal / local camera captures and logs
live.h264
*.log
test_out/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
sdist/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
.eggs/
.installed.cfg
MANIFEST

